ormal at 35 ms and errors stayed at 0; orders-db log states no failed checkout transaction reached orders-db for request_id=req-8812.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"signal\": \"cdn-edge 5xx errors\",\n      \"why_not_primary\": \"CDN metrics say the 5xx increase was isolated to images, and checkout-web log says static assets served normally after retry while checkout remained blocked by payment auth failures.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"signal\": \"payment-api elevated latency and 401s\",\n      \"why_not_primary\": \"Payment API logs attribute the failures to upstream auth-gateway invalid issuer responses, so payment-api is an affected downstream service rather than the origin.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"recommended_next_steps\": [\n    \"Mitigate by restoring auth-gateway allowed_issuers to include partner-v2 or by reverting AUTH-2026-0318.\",\n    \"Flush or rebuild the auth-gateway JWKS cache namespace after the issuer configuration is corrected to remove partner-v1 fallback behavior.\",\n    \"Verify recovery by checking auth-gateway validation logs for successful partner-v2 tokens and confirming checkout-web/payment-api 401 rates return to baseline.\",\n    \"Review deployment safeguards so issuer rotation and allowed_issuers changes are validated together before rollout.\"\n  ]\n}\n"},"partialResult":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Writing 2943 bytes to out/root_cause.json..."}],"details":{"resolvedPath":"/workspace/out/root_cause.json"}}}
